IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. MAINP.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-A PIC 9(4) VALUE 7.
01 WS-B PIC 9(4) VALUE 3.
01 WS-R PIC 9(8) VALUE 0.
01 WS-P PIC 9(8) VALUE 0.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    CALL "ADDER" USING WS-A WS-B WS-R.
    DISPLAY "sum=" WS-R.
    CALL "MULER" USING WS-A WS-B WS-P.
    DISPLAY "prod=" WS-P.
    STOP RUN.
END PROGRAM MAINP.

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. ADDER.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LK-A PIC 9(4).
01 LK-B PIC 9(4).
01 LK-R PIC 9(8).
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-A LK-B LK-R.
    COMPUTE LK-R = LK-A + LK-B.
    GOBACK.
END PROGRAM ADDER.

IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. MULER.
DATA DIVISION.
LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LK-A PIC 9(4).
01 LK-B PIC 9(4).
01 LK-P PIC 9(8).
PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-A LK-B LK-P.
    COMPUTE LK-P = LK-A * LK-B.
    GOBACK.
END PROGRAM MULER.
